{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52339","headline":"诗（幷序） 一○○ · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 一○○","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸿鹄尽（项校「昼」）飞扬，蝙蝠夜陵（项校「纷」）泊。\n幽显虽不同，志性不相博（张改作「搏」，袁谓不误）。\n他家求官官（张改作「宦」），我专慕客作。\n斋得贰斗米，铛前交摎脚。\n脱帽安怀中，坐儿膝头着。\n不羡荣华好，不羞贫贱恶。\n随缘适世间，自得恣情乐。\n无事强人选，散官先即着。\n年年愁上番，猕猴带[斧]（父）凿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52339.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52339","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}